From 617050da6a85573cc619b2c45cc901bcf847ec67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kimi <kimi@moonshot.ai>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 12:42:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve P0-P2 runtime defects from NOT_WORKING.md

#1 move handleSnapshot pipeline off the main thread (Dispatchers.Default)
#2 dispatch overlay actions to a background scope; drop runBlocking in pauses
#3 reuse the mapped accessibility tree instead of mapping it twice per burst
#4 guard background startForegroundService; notify user when Android blocks it
#5 stop the monitoring foreground service when accessibility is revoked
#6 live notification status text; Resume action replaces Pause while paused
#7 tolerate chat-title flicker in ConversationDetector (no dropped messages)
#8 'user is typing' now requires a real text-change event, not any window event
#9 expanded overlay card scrolls so STOP/Send stay reachable on small screens
#10 Home screen prominently warns when no model/API key is configured
---
